From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LiuLianPi BSP <dev@localhost>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: simple: add generic "simple-panel" support

The in-tree panel-simple driver only matches specific panel model
compatibles. Device trees that use the generic "simple-panel" (with a
panel-timing node describing the panel) never get a panel driver bound,
which makes sun4i-tcon defer its probe forever and leaves sun4i-drm
without any registered card.

Add a generic entry populating the timing bounds so the existing
device tree override mechanism (panel_simple_parse_panel_timing_node)
accepts the panel-timing properties. This keeps the DRM mode set in
sync with the timings already used by U-Boot.

Signed-off-by: LiuLianPi BSP <dev@localhost>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-simple.c | 26 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 26 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-simple.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-simple.c
@@ -3108,6 +3108,29 @@
 	.bus_format = MEDIA_BUS_FMT_RGB888_1X24,
 };
 
+static const struct display_timing simple_panel_timing = {
+	.pixelclock = { 30000000, 40000000, 60000000 },
+	.hactive = { 1024, 1024, 1024 },
+	.hfront_porch = { 1, 150, 300 },
+	.hback_porch = { 1, 150, 300 },
+	.hsync_len = { 1, 20, 100 },
+	.vactive = { 600, 600, 600 },
+	.vfront_porch = { 1, 15, 60 },
+	.vback_porch = { 1, 15, 60 },
+	.vsync_len = { 1, 5, 60 },
+	.flags = DISPLAY_FLAGS_HSYNC_HIGH | DISPLAY_FLAGS_VSYNC_HIGH,
+};
+
+static const struct panel_desc simple_panel_desc = {
+	.timings = &simple_panel_timing,
+	.num_timings = 1,
+	.bpc = 6,
+	.size = {
+		.width = 154,
+		.height = 86,
+	},
+};
+
 static const struct of_device_id platform_of_match[] = {
 	{
 		.compatible = "ampire,am-480272h3tmqw-t01h",
@@ -3436,6 +3459,9 @@
 	}, {
 		.compatible = "winstar,wf35ltiacd",
 		.data = &winstar_wf35ltiacd,
+	}, {
+		.compatible = "simple-panel",
+		.data = &simple_panel_desc,
 	}, {
 		/* sentinel */
 	}
